{"version":1,"key":"card:275","content":{"id":275,"content":[{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"559b12ed-f460-44c6-926f-278d97baa7c5","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"如果重写了原型中的方法，如何访问原型中的方法。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"9395b3e1-23cf-483d-afca-75de80a51bc7","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"在 ES5 中，通过 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"Object.getPrototypeOf(this).[method].call(this)"},{"type":"formatted","text":"来访问原型"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"js","uuid":"dcadd127-e81b-4e31-9cdd-298aca5c7ff0","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"064ca7a5-6ca8-4599-8f78-aaeb1a97105e","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"const person = {\n  sayHello() {\n    return \"Hello\";\n  },\n};\nconst dog = {\n  sayHello() {\n    return \"Woff\";\n  },\n};\n\nconst friend = {\n  sayHello() {\n    return Object.getPrototypeOf(this).sayHello.call(this) + \", Man!\";\n  },\n};\n\nObject.setPrototypeOf(friend, person);\nconsole.log(friend.sayHello()); // Hello, Man!\n\nObject.setPrototypeOf(friend, dog);\nconsole.log(friend.sayHello()); // Woff, Man!","collabId":"a4c192f9-52a5-4e78-86b8-ec3a44cc6ea4","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"66c59154-0833-4578-ba27-05ac297f0d98","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"在 ES6 中引入了 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"super"},{"type":"formatted","text":"，"},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"super"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 表示原型对象"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"js","uuid":"7b99a829-d5a1-4822-88ec-fac4cfc857ea","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"70490ee6-04d9-4f6b-ab66-ea13a55e3ae9","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"const friend = {\n  sayHello() {\n    return super.sayHello.call(this) + \", Man!\";\n  },\n};","collabId":"0ce45a5d-f8ea-4fce-9a8d-7a3bb6254552","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"19ab7797-4f24-4098-a68f-d315aee054f4","children":[{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"super"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 只能在简写方法中使用，如下会发生语法错误"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"js","uuid":"f81eafab-24b0-4b3f-bb71-0e76b45562d1","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"40615639-a33f-4033-a7a0-5ec9dbd423c7","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"let friend = {\n  sayHello: function () {\n    // SyntaxError: 'super' keyword unexpected here\n    return super.sayHello.call(this) + \", Man!\";\n  },\n};","collabId":"52e51249-0c9b-4798-83cb-5642ca041056","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]}],"tags":["JavaScript/类"],"createTime":1692111070670,"updateTime":1743303640422,"linkedCards":[{"id":269,"target":{"key":"card:269","type":"card","id":269},"summary":"ES6 为对象提供了一些简写的方式。 当属性名和值所对应的变量名相同时，可以简写 const name = \"Alice\"; const age = 18; const person = { name: name, age: age, };...","tags":["JavaScript"]},{"id":274,"target":{"key":"card:274","type":"card","id":274},"summary":"几个与原型相关的方法。 在创建对象时，可以通过 Object.create 为对象指定一个原型 const person = { sayHello() { console.log(\"Hello\"); }, }; const friend =...","tags":["JavaScript"]},{"id":281,"target":{"key":"card:281","type":"card","id":281},"summary":"通过关键字 extends 即可来继承一个类，继承自其它类的类称为子类，或者派生类。在子类的构造方法 constructor 中， 必须首先通过调用 super 方法来调用父类的构造函数 ，它会在这里初始化 this ，如果没有调用 sup...","tags":["JavaScript/类"]}]},"meta":{"type":"card","publishTime":1743303640422}}